# Save/load regression through F-Zero X's own Options menu. From the default
# GP Race tile, Down selects the lower-left tile (Course Edit redirects to
# Practice in cartridge-only builds), then Right selects Options.
WAITTITLE 3600
PRESS START 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS DOWN 3
WAIT 30
PRESS RIGHT 3
WAIT 30
PRESS A 3
WAITMODE 20 3600
WAIT 180
PRESS RIGHT 3
WAIT 120
PRESS B 3
WAITMODE 7 3600
LOG sram_toggle_saved_and_returned
WAIT 120
QUIT
